an>Introduction</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Understanding ai pet safety</h2></div><div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><p>One in three pets goes missing at some point, and the first hour determines the outcome more than anything that follows. Most owners lose that hour simply discovering the animal is gone.</p><p>PawlogicTech removes that delay. Boundary breaches, unusual movement and escape-risk conditions trigger alerts immediately, and a structured recovery workflow begins the moment you confirm.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-background p-8 sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">The problem</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">Recovery fails on time, not on effort</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Search radius grows roughly with the square of elapsed time. A thirty-minute head start turns a street-level search into a district-level one, and posters go up after the window that mattered has closed.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Owners typically notice an escape long after it happens.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Basic trackers report location but never predict risk.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Panic responses such as fireworks cause the highest-risk escapes.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Microchips only work once somebody finds and scans the animal.</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-primary p-8 text-primary-foreground sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Our solution</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">Predict, detect, respond</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Escape risk is forecast from weather, fireworks calendars, behavioural arousal and historical patterns. Boundary breaches alert instantly, and recovery is a guided workflow rather than an improvised scramble.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Risk forecasting ahead of high-danger events.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Live tracking with intelligent power management.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Multi-layer geofencing around home, garden and known routes.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Emergency contact cascade and community alerting.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Benefits</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">What you get out of it</h2></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Minutes, not hours</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Escape detection starts the clock immediately rather than when you notice.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Prevention first</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Risk warnings before firework nights, storms and known trigger events.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Coordinated recovery</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A structured workflow instead of panic and guesswork.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Everyday safety</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Heat stress, prolonged inactivity and hazard-zone entry all covered.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-secondary"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Features</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Everything included as standard</h2></div><dl class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Live location</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">GPS with dense-urban and indoor fallback positioning.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Adaptive geofencing</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foregro