l">Households and organisations this is built for</h2></div><dl class="mt-8 space-y-6"><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Escape artists</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Dogs that dig, climb or bolt, and cats with unpredictable roaming ranges.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Noise-phobic animals</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Pets at high risk during fireworks season and thunderstorms.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Rural households</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Large boundaries and livestock proximity requiring wider zone control.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Urban high-traffic areas</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Where minutes genuinely determine survival.</dd></div></dl></div><img alt="Veterinary professional reviewing ai pet safety data for a patient" class="w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lift" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/vet-review.webp" width="1200"/></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-primary text-primary-foreground"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Why PawlogicTech</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Clinically governed, privacy-first, and deliberately quiet</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Every threshold in AI Pet Safety is reviewed by our veterinary advisory panel before release. We tune for clinical usefulness rather than notification volume, we compare your animal only against itself, and we never sell your data. Everything exports, because the record belongs to you and should follow your animal wherever it goes.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24" id="faq"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>FAQ</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">AI Pet Safety questions, answered</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How accurate is the location tracking?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Typically three to five metres outdoors with clear sky. In dense urban environments or indoors, accuracy is maintained to roughly ten to fifteen metres using assisted positioning.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What is the battery life?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Around fourteen days in standard monitoring. In active tracking mode during a recovery, expect approximately eighteen hours of continuous high-frequency reporting.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Does it work abroad?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. Multi-network roaming is included across most of Europe and North America with no additional configuration.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Is a subscription required?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Location services require a connectivity plan because the device uses cellular networks. Local features such as geofence alerts within range of your home hub continue regardless.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Related services</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Services that pair well with this one</h2></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-health-monitoring/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">AI Pet Health Monitoring</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Continuous vitals, early-warning alerts and vet-ready health records.</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">AI Behavior Analysis</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Understand anxiety, aggression and stress through measured behaviour.</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">AI Pet Training</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Adaptive, reward-based training programmes that measure real progress.</p></div></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Further reading</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Articles from our veterinary and behavioural team</h2></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><li><article><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Pet Health · 8 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/early-signs-of-illness-in-dogs/' ) ); ?>">The Early Signs of Illness in Dogs Most Owners Miss</a></h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">By the time a dog looks unwell, the condition has usually been developing for weeks. These are the eight signals that appear first, and why almost nobody notices them.</p></article></li><li><article><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Behaviour · 7 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 